{"type":"text","timestamp":1794046522371,"sessionID":"ses_e4a838527ffe8oucTkjfNF4FOG","part":{"id":"prt_1b58147e9001yVJrY0JN3UZbtj","messageID":"msg_1b58119bf001H0OsO3O1OiU0fp","sessionID":"ses_e4a838527ffe8oucTkjfNF4FOG","type":"text","text":"\n\n## Objective\n- Implement `ledgerkit/slots.py` with `free_slots(busy, day_start, day_end, min_minutes=0)` and tests in `tests/test_slots.py` for the `ledgerkit` repository.\n- Run `python3 -m pytest -q`, commit the work to the current branch, and report the command/result.\n\n## Important Details\n- Working directory: `/home/user/latte-crew/var/worktrees/1107-b2704c`.\n- Branch: `crew/1107-b2704c`; do not push or switch branches.\n- Required function signature: `free_slots(busy, day_start, day_end, min_minutes=0)`.\n- `busy` is a list of timezone-aware `(start, end)` datetime tuples; may be overlapping, unsorted, and in different UTC offsets.\n- `day_start` and `day_end` must be timezone-aware.\n- Return free gaps inside `[day_start, day_end]` as a sorted list of `(start, end)` tuples expressed in `day_start`'s timezone.\n- Busy intervals are clipped to the window; intervals entirely outside are ignored.\n- Touching busy intervals merge; no zero-length gaps are returned.\n- Keep only gaps at least `min_minutes` long.\n- Raise `ValueError` if any datetime is naive, if any busy interval has `end < start`, or if `day_end <= day_start`.\n- Zero-length busy intervals are ignored.\n- Existing repo style: small `ledgerkit` package, tests run with `python3 -m pytest -q`.\n\n## Work State\n### Completed\n- Created `/home/user/latte-crew/var/worktrees/1107-b2704c/ledgerkit/slots.py` with `free_slots` and `_is_naive`.\n- Created `/home/user/latte-crew/var/worktrees/1107-b2704c/tests/test_slots.py` with 22 tests covering empty busy, clipping, merging, unsorted/overlapping intervals, touching intervals, zero-length busy, mixed timezones, `min_minutes` filtering, and `ValueError` cases.\n- Fixed test bugs: invalid hour argument, non-callable timezone objects, and `datetime.tzinfo` name collision.\n- Ran `python3 -m pytest -q` in `/home/user/latte-crew/var/worktrees/1107-b2704c`; actual result: `22 passed in 0.03s`.\n- Committed work to `crew/1107-b2704c` as `0a201aa Add ledgerkit.slots.free_slots for computing free time gaps`.\n\n### Active\n- None.\n\n### Blocked\n- None.\n\n## Next Move\n1. Final report should state that `python3 -m pytest -q` was run and returned `22 passed in 0.03s`.\n2. Confirm no further changes are needed and no push was performed.\n\n## Relevant Files\n- `/home/user/latte-crew/var/worktrees/1107-b2704c/ledgerkit/slots.py`: implementation of `free_slots`.\n- `/home/user/latte-crew/var/worktrees/1107-b2704c/tests/test_slots.py`: tests for `free_slots`.\n- `/home/user/latte-crew/var/worktrees/1107-b2704c/ledgerkit/money.py`: existing package module, unchanged.\n- `/home/user/latte-crew/var/worktrees/1107-b2704c/tests/test_money.py`: existing test, unchanged.","time":{"start":1794046511081,"end":1794046522367}}}
