{"type":"text","timestamp":1794046687223,"sessionID":"ses_e4a838527ffe8oucTkjfNF4FOG","part":{"id":"prt_1b583b544001HvpglfFK6Gg3R5","messageID":"msg_1b5830778001AmoYoojh8EWpdf","sessionID":"ses_e4a838527ffe8oucTkjfNF4FOG","type":"text","text":"\n\n## Objective\n- Fix a DST wall-clock arithmetic bug in `ledgerkit/slots.py` identified by a senior reviewer: all interval logic (clip, sort, merge, gap computation, `min_minutes` filter) must run in UTC, not in `day_start.tzinfo`, so that fall-back/spring-forward days yield correct elapsed durations.\n- Add two regression tests (fall-back day 25 h gap; busy interval inside the repeated hour), run `python3 -m pytest -q`, commit to `crew/1107-b2704c`.\n\n## Important Details\n- Working directory: `/home/user/latte-crew/var/worktrees/1107-b2704c`; branch `crew/1107-b2704c`; **never push or switch branches**.\n- Python 3.12.3.\n- **Verified bug**: `datetime(2025,11,3,0,0,tzinfo=ZoneInfo('America/New_York')) - datetime(2025,11,2,0,0,tzinfo=ZoneInfo('America/New_York'))` returns `1 day, 0:00:00` (24 h) instead of 25 h; `free_slots([], ds, de, min_minutes=24*60+30)` returns `[]` instead of the full 25 h gap. Python's aware-datetime **subtraction** uses wall-clock arithmetic and ignores UTC offset (comparison does account for offset).\n- **Prescribed fix**: convert `day_start`, `day_end`, and every busy `start`/`end` via `.astimezone(timezone.utc)`; perform clip, sort, merge, gap loop, and `min_seconds` filter entirely in UTC; convert gap endpoints back via `.astimezone(day_start.tzinfo)` only when building the return list.\n- `busy` is a list of tz-aware `(start, end)` tuples; may be overlapping, unsorted, mixed offsets.\n- Return sorted list of `(start, end)` in `day_start`'s timezone; zero-length gaps omitted; gaps shorter than `min_minutes` omitted.\n- `ValueError` for: naive datetimes, `end < start` in any busy interval, `day_end <= day_start`.\n- Zero-length busy intervals are silently ignored.\n- Prior commit `0a201aa` contains the original 22-test implementation; this fix is a follow-up on the same branch.\n\n## Work State\n### Completed\n- Original `ledgerkit/slots.py` + `tests/test_slots.py` (22 tests) created, tested, committed as `0a201aa`.\n- Empirically verified the DST bug in the sandbox: `de - ds` = 24 h (not 25 h); `free_slots([], ds, de, min_minutes=24*60+30)` = `[]` on Python 3.12.3 with `ZoneInfo('America/New_York')`.\n\n### Active\n- Refactor `free_slots` in `ledgerkit/slots.py` to perform all interval arithmetic in UTC (`.astimezone(timezone.utc)`), then convert gap endpoints back to `day_start.tzinfo` for the return value.\n- Add two new tests to `tests/test_slots.py`:\n  1. Fall-back day (2025-11-02 NY, 00:00→00:00 next day): `free_slots([], day_start, day_end, min_minutes=24*60+30)` must return the full 25-hour gap `[(day_start, day_end)]`.\n  2. Busy interval inside the repeated 01:00–02:00 hour (e.g. 01:30–01:45 EDT via `timezone(timedelta(hours=-4))`): verify correct gap splitting and total free time = 24 h 15 min.\n\n### Blocked\n- None.\n\n## Next Move\n1. Rewrite `free_slots` in `/home/user/latte-crew/var/worktrees/1107-b2704c/ledgerkit/slots.py`: import `timezone` from `datetime`, convert `day_start`/`day_end`/busy intervals to UTC, do clip/sort/merge/gap/filter in UTC, convert gap endpoints back to `day_start.tzinfo` before returning.\n2. Add the two DST regression tests to `/home/user/latte-crew/var/worktrees/1107-b2704c/tests/test_slots.py`.\n3. Run `python3 -m pytest -q`; confirm all tests pass (expected 24 passed).\n4. Commit to `crew/1107-b2704c` with a clear message describing the UTC-normalization fix; report command and result.\n\n## Relevant Files\n- `/home/user/latte-crew/var/worktrees/1107-b2704c/ledgerkit/slots.py`: contains `free_slots` and `_is_naive`; needs UTC-normalization refactor.\n- `/home/user/latte-crew/var/worktrees/1107-b2704c/tests/test_slots.py`: 22 existing tests; needs 2 new DST regression tests.\n- `/home/user/latte-crew/var/worktrees/1107-b2704c/ledgerkit/money.py`: existing package module, unchanged.\n- `/home/user/latte-crew/var/worktrees/1107-b2704c/tests/test_money.py`: existing test, unchanged.","time":{"start":1794046670148,"end":1794046687219}}}
